  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 718f67b7b841dde4a89478ad5ef11627, type: 3}
  m_Name: Dialogue_Ch3_1_Board
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Zmywak.Narrative::Zmywak.Narrative.Dialogue.DialogueGraph
  startNodeId: board_1
  nodes:
  - nodeId: board_1
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Czwartek, dziewi\u0105ta rano. Kuchnia bez go\u015Bci wygl\u0105da inaczej: cicha, jasna, pachnie wybielaczem i cebul\u0105."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: So you're Declan's new project. I'm Gavin. Sous-chef. That means when Declan's not here, I'm God.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Gavin. Zast\u0119pca szefa kuchni. U\u015Bmiecha si\u0119 tak, jak u\u015Bmiecha si\u0119 pies, zanim ugryzie."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - project
    - means
    - here
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: ch2_prep_cook
    branchNodeId: board_first
    nextNodeId: board_ask
  - nodeId: board_ask
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Well, Kooba? Gavin's been doing prep all week and giving out about it. Made up your mind?
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "\"Giving out\": Gavin robi wyrzuty. Ca\u0142ej kuchni, od tygodnia. Przy mnie zacznie od nowa."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - made
    - mind
    - week
    unlockSlangIds:
    - slang_giving_out
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Bior\u0119 desk\u0119."
      targetNodeId: board_take
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Zostaj\u0119 przy zlewie."
      targetNodeId: board_sink
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: board_take
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Good man. Apron's on the hook. Gavin, show him the onions.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - apron
    - hook
    - show
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_prep_cook
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: board_first
  - nodeId: board_sink
    lines:
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Fair enough. A good man at the sink is worth two at the board.
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Knew it. They never stay at the board.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Mo\u017Ce ma racj\u0119. A mo\u017Ce po prostu wiem, gdzie jest moje miejsce. Na razie."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - worth
    - two
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_stays_sink
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 5
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: board_end
  - nodeId: board_first
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Dziesi\u0119\u0107 kilo cebuli, pi\u0119\u0107 kilo marchwi, seler. Gavin stawia obok minutnik i patrzy."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Brunoise. Three millimetres. My granny cuts faster, and she's been dead since ninety-eight.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - three
    - faster
    - dead
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_at_board
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices:
    - choiceText: "Tn\u0119 szybko, \u017Ceby nad\u0105\u017Cy\u0107 za minutnikiem."
      targetNodeId: board_fast
      requiredFlag: 
    - choiceText: "Tn\u0119 powoli, tak jak pokaza\u0142 Declan."
      targetNodeId: board_careful
      requiredFlag: 
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
  - nodeId: board_fast
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Si\xF3dma cebula. N\xF3\u017C ze\u015Blizguje si\u0119 z k\u0142ykcia. Krew na desce, krew na fartuchu."
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: Ah, for... Blue plaster. So you'll find it in the soup, not the customer.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Niebieski plaster. W kuchni wszystkie s\u0105 niebieskie, bo nie ma niebieskiego jedzenia. Pierwsza lekcja deski."
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - blue
    - plaster
    - soup
    - customer
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_cut_finger
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: -10
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: board_end
  - nodeId: board_careful
    lines:
    - speakerId: narrator
      language: 0
      text: "Minutnik dzwoni trzy razy, zanim Kuba ko\u0144czy. Gavin przewraca oczami. Potem Declan bierze \u0142y\u017Ck\u0119 kostek i ogl\u0105da je pod lamp\u0105."
    - speakerId: declan
      language: 1
      text: Three millimetres. Every one. Gavin, look at this.
    - speakerId: gavin
      language: 1
      text: ...Grand. It's grand.
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: W ustach Gavina "grand" brzmi jak przegrana. Uczciwa wymiana.
    teachVocabularyWords:
    - every
    - look
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags:
    - ch3_careful
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 5
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: board_end
  - nodeId: board_end
    lines:
    - speakerId: kuba_thought
      language: 0
      text: "Wieczorem r\u0119ce pachn\u0105 cebul\u0105 mimo trzech my\u0107. Mama m\xF3wi\u0142a, \u017Ce pomaga cytryna. Nie mamy cytryny. Mamy cebul\u0119."
    teachVocabularyWords: []
    unlockSlangIds: []
    setFlags: []
    outcome:
      moneyEuros: 0
      energy: 0
      homesickness: 0
      integration: 0
    choices: []
    branchIfFlag: 
    branchNodeId: 
    nextNodeId: 
